# Sampling note: we use `nutpie` (Numba-compiled NUTS) rather than the default
# PyTensor C backend. On Windows this removes the need for a C++ toolchain and
# is substantially faster; on Linux CI it behaves identically, so local and CI
# runs sample from the same implementation.

